WEBVTT

00:02:17.643 --> 00:02:19.923
(MELLOW MUSIC PLAYING)

00:03:25.043 --> 00:03:27.363
(UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYING)

00:06:47.803 --> 00:06:49.483
(PANTING RAPIDLY)

00:06:53.523 --> 00:06:55.403
(SIGHING LOUDLY)

00:06:56.163 --> 00:06:58.923
I made it! My first day of class!

00:07:00.323 --> 00:07:03.923
Uh, the school year's over, son.
You missed it.

00:07:05.923 --> 00:07:06.963
Great.

00:07:07.243 --> 00:07:08.643
(INHALES DEEPLY)

00:07:08.723 --> 00:07:10.403
(PANTING RAPIDLY)

